* Integrated Chain: Guitar -> VCF -> Output (rail-connected opamps)
.include /home/szilu/Documents/synth/netlists/opamp.lib

VCC VCC 0 DC 12
VEE VEE 0 DC -12

VIN IN 0 SIN(0 0.1 220)

* Hi-Z input
CIN IN N1 100n
RHI N1 0 1MEG

* Buffer
Xbuf N1 NB NB VCC VEE OPAMP

* Preamp gain ~10x
Rg NB Nfb 10k
Rf Nfb Npre 90k
Xpre NB Nfb Npre VCC VEE OPAMP

* VCF (simplified Sallen-Key, cutoff ~1.6kHz)
R1 Npre NA 10k
C1 NA 0 10n
R2 NA NB2 10k
C2 NB2 0 10n
Xbuf2 NB2 FILT FILT VCC VEE OPAMP

* Output
Cdc FILT NO 10u
Rdc NO 0 100k
RV1 NO W 50k
RV2 W 0 50k
Xline W LINE LINE VCC VEE OPAMP
Xhp W HPOUT HPOUT VCC VEE OPAMP
RL HPOUT 0 32

* Decoupling
Cdec1 VCC 0 100n
Cdec2 VEE 0 100n
Cbulk1 VCC 0 10u
Cbulk2 VEE 0 10u

.control
tran 20u 1 0 uic
wrdata /tmp/integrated_chain.cir.csv time HPOUT
.endc
.end